  "body": "There are instances of the `%CLIENT_MAJOR_VERSION%` placeholder appearing in the spec text, as seen [here](https://spec.matrix.org/unstable/application-service-api/#server-admin-style-permissions). I believe in the old spec this was replaced with the CS API major version number.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure how this interacts with the new Matrix Spec Versioning stuff, but we probably want to write a Hugo template for this.",
